      "source_group": "indicvoices_r/S4259065500397435",
      "review_status": "unreviewed"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev_01_0",
      "text": "हाम्रो समुदायमा अभ्यासमा रहेका परम्परागत कृषि अभ्यासहरूको बारेमा बताउनु पर्दा",
      "speaker_id": "S4257751100369637",
      "reference_audio": "/Volumes/T9/indicvoices_r_ne/audio/S4257751100369637_009829.wav",
      "reference_text": "जन्मसिद्ध अधिकारको निम्ति चाहिँ झुक्दै नझुक्नु भन्ने खालको",
      "reference_sha256": "6ed10838a90596e8775880ff7a3116342079317d98b9ec29fe1737eaeebe9e6b",
      "seed": 0,
      "split": "train",
      "native_audio": "/Volumes/T9/indicvoices_r_ne/audio/S4257751100369637_006521.wav",
      "native_sha256": "dd8980c3a7c7a8775dee78781286b8bee3052cb93efa4a2137604ea4a0dcae8c",
      "source_group": "indicvoices_r/S4257751100369637",
      "review_status": "unreviewed"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev_01_1",
      "text": "जस्तै अब दौरा सुरुवालहरू ल लगाउँछन् हैन खुकुरी भिर्छन् खुकुरी भिर्ने चलन छ",
      "speaker_id": "S4257751100369637",
      "reference_audio": "/Volumes/T9/indicvoices_r_ne/audio/S4257751100369637_009829.wav",
      "reference_text": "जन्मसिद्ध अधिकारको निम्ति चाहिँ झुक्दै नझुक्नु भन्ने खालको",
      "reference_sha256": "6ed10838a90596e8775880ff7a3116342079317d98b9ec29fe1737eaeebe9e6b",
      "seed": 0,
      "split": "train",
      "native_audio": "/Volumes/T9/indicvoices_r_ne/audio/S4257751100369637_015616.wav",
