      "source_group": "indicvoices_r/S4257387500340373",
      "review_status": "unreviewed"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev_07_0",
      "text": "दार्जिलिङ जिल्लामा मुख्य प्राकृतिक स्रोत वन जङ्गल चिया उद्योग",
      "speaker_id": "S4257689200333878",
      "reference_audio": "/Volumes/T9/indicvoices_r_ne/audio/S4257689200333878_001003.wav",
      "reference_text": "मेरो वस्तु सूचीबाट नेचर ल्यान्ड अर्गानिक्स कसुरी मेथी हटाउनु होस्",
      "reference_sha256": "1e15d89ce82208962c53b4e2c5c1a609396bf1df5555fa2942a3dc90cee28ef5",
      "seed": 0,
      "split": "train",
      "native_audio": "/Volumes/T9/indicvoices_r_ne/audio/S4257689200333878_021257.wav",
      "native_sha256": "1f0e6a0bdd00846ac145bfc4577a9f71673cdf3663b37085f51149d241f954a4",
      "source_group": "indicvoices_r/S4257689200333878",
      "review_status": "unreviewed"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev_07_1",
      "text": "मलाई धेरै थरीका कार्डहरू थाहा छ जस्तै डेबिट कार्ड क्रेडिट कार्ड",
      "speaker_id": "S4257689200333878",
      "reference_audio": "/Volumes/T9/indicvoices_r_ne/audio/S4257689200333878_001003.wav",
      "reference_text": "मेरो वस्तु सूचीबाट नेचर ल्यान्ड अर्गानिक्स कसुरी मेथी हटाउनु होस्",
      "reference_sha256": "1e15d89ce82208962c53b4e2c5c1a609396bf1df5555fa2942a3dc90cee28ef5",
      "seed": 0,
      "split": "train",
      "native_audio": "/Volumes/T9/indicvoices_r_ne/audio/S4257689200333878_022422.wav",
