      "source_group": "indicvoices_r/S4257689200333878",
      "review_status": "unreviewed"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev_08_0",
      "text": "यस उदाहरणका लागि यो शुल्कमा सात सौ पचास डलर अतिरिक्त लागत दाबी गर्दछ",
      "speaker_id": "S4259675300304689",
      "reference_audio": "/Volumes/T9/indicvoices_r_ne/audio/S4259675300304689_013364.wav",
      "reference_text": "हुनसकेन त्यसले गर्दाखेरि त्यसमा पनि दुःख लागेको थियो लडाइँभन्दा पनि",
      "reference_sha256": "3c9cf5e6e5fa49f4cddcf3934646b1d678d856c9edd925154aa1fe39d115514e",
      "seed": 0,
      "split": "train",
      "native_audio": "/Volumes/T9/indicvoices_r_ne/audio/S4259675300304689_014859.wav",
      "native_sha256": "929b8d73053f59fde7a3eb32f4630a41e2132d5561e450fced7e60fec3b79218",
      "source_group": "indicvoices_r/S4259675300304689",
      "review_status": "unreviewed"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev_08_1",
      "text": "चोलामण्डलम फाइनेन्सबाट सम्पत्ति विरुद्ध ऋणका लागि रिमाइन्डर मेटाउनुहोस्",
      "speaker_id": "S4259675300304689",
      "reference_audio": "/Volumes/T9/indicvoices_r_ne/audio/S4259675300304689_013364.wav",
      "reference_text": "हुनसकेन त्यसले गर्दाखेरि त्यसमा पनि दुःख लागेको थियो लडाइँभन्दा पनि",
      "reference_sha256": "3c9cf5e6e5fa49f4cddcf3934646b1d678d856c9edd925154aa1fe39d115514e",
      "seed": 0,
      "split": "train",
      "native_audio": "/Volumes/T9/indicvoices_r_ne/audio/S4259675300304689_007002.wav",
